\paragraph{Roadmap to Final Demonstration (New Content).}
With Stages 1 through 5 fully achieved for the mid-term milestone, remaining work prior to the final submission (Nov 13) focuses on hardware synthesis and physical board demonstration:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Vivado Synthesis \& Timing Closure:} Synthesize the top-level Verilog design targeting the Spartan-7 XC7S50 on the RealDigital Boolean Board at 100~MHz, recording final post-implementation LUT, FF, DSP, and BRAM utilization.
    \item \textbf{Hardware Playback Demonstration:} Interface the host PC to the Boolean Board over USB-UART at 230,400 baud using a Python streaming harness, transmitting pre-recorded seizure clips and demonstrating real-time alarm assertions on board LEDs and 7-segment displays.
    \item \textbf{Final Report Documentation:} Document complete physical measurements, power dissipation from Vivado Power Analyzer, and side-by-side latency comparisons.
\end{enumerate}
